  "name": "ESM-2",
  "alternateName": ["Evolutionary Scale Modeling 2", "facebook/esm2"],
  "description": "State-of-the-art protein language model family from Meta AI, trained on 250 million protein sequences using masked language modelling. Available in six sizes (8M–15B parameters). Enables protein structure prediction, function prediction, and variant effect estimation directly from amino acid sequences — without requiring multiple sequence alignments. Foundation for ESMFold (structure prediction) and widely used for fine-tuning across drug discovery and genomics tasks. 2.5M+ HuggingFace downloads per month.",
